  },
  "s13b04": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 133.938,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "Are you just here to scare me forever?",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s13b04.wav",
   "end": 135.948,
   "sfx": [
    "sob"
   ]
  },
  "s13b05": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 136.448,
   "end": 139.448,
   "sfx": [
    "sob"
   ]
  },
  "s13b06": {
   "scene": "s13",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 139.448,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the void did not move. It stood there.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s13b06.wav",
   "end": 143.5
  },
  "s14b01": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 144.95,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "But then, the void turned its gaze toward my fear.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s14b01.wav",
   "end": 148.43,
   "sfx": [
    "rumble_low",
    "heartbeat"
   ]
  },
  "s14b02": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 148.73,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "This is it.",
   "inner": true,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s14b02.wav",
   "end": 149.66,
   "sfx": [
    "heartbeat"
   ]
  },
  "s14b03": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 150.16,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "It thought the void had had enough of its complaining, and would destroy it.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s14b03.wav",
   "end": 154.89,
   "sfx": [
    "heartbeat"
   ]
  },
  "s14b04": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 155.29,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "So it hid its head in its hands.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s14b04.wav",
   "end": 157.22,
   "sfx": [
    "breath_shaky"
   ]
  },
  "s14b05": {
   "scene": "s14",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 157.52,
   "end": 159.02,
   "sfx": [
    "heartbeat"
   ]
  },
  "s15b01": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 159.47,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "But then, my fear felt a hand on its shoulder.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s15b01.wav",
   "end": 162.65,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s15b02": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 163.15,
   "end": 165.15
  },
  "s15b03": {
   "scene": "s15",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 165.15,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And it looked up, into the face of the void.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s15b03.wav",
   "end": 168.12
  },
  "s16b01": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 169.52,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And instead of pure darkness, it saw the twinkling of lights.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s16b01.wav",
   "end": 173.44,
   "sfx": [
    "shimmer",
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s16b02": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 173.94,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Like galaxies, and nebulae, and stars of the universe.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s16b02.wav",
   "end": 178.3,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s16b03": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 178.8,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The void, filled with bits and pieces of meaning.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s16b03.wav",
   "end": 182.12,
   "sfx": [
    "shimmer"
   ]
  },
  "s16b04": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 182.62,
   "end": 185.12,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s16b05": {
   "scene": "s16",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 185.12,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And my fear had tears in its eyes.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s16b05.wav",
   "end": 187.49
  },
  "s17b01": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 188.74,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Instead of feeling like it would get hurt, it felt wonder, and amazement.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s17b01.wav",
   "end": 193.82,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s17b02": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 194.32,
   "speaker": "FEAR",
   "text": "Why are you showing me this?",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s17b02.wav",
   "end": 195.87
  },
  "s17b03": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 196.67,
   "end": 198.17,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s17b04": {
   "scene": "s17",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 198.17,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The void took its hand away, and stared into the screen of my consciousness.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s17b04.wav",
   "end": 203.65
  },
  "s18b01": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 204.6,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And when my fear looked there too, my other emotions were looking back.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s18b01.wav",
   "end": 209.3
  },
  "s18b03": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 209.7,
   "end": 212.2
  },
  "s18b04": {
   "scene": "s18",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 212.2,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "They smiled, just briefly, then went back to work, helping my consciousness.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s18b04.wav",
   "end": 217.47,
   "sfx": [
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s19b01": {
   "scene": "s19",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 218.42,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And my fear wiped the tears from its eyes.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s19b01.wav",
   "end": 221.25,
   "sfx": [
    "cloth_rustle"
   ]
  },
  "s19b02": {
   "scene": "s19",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 221.55,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Then it felt a gentle push, toward my emotions.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s19b02.wav",
   "end": 224.99,
   "sfx": [
    "footsteps"
   ]
  },
  "s20b01": {
   "scene": "s20",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 225.74,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And fear looked over its shoulder, at the void.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s20b01.wav",
   "end": 228.76
  },
  "s20b02": {
   "scene": "s20",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 229.06,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The void stood there, with galaxies twinkling in its dark facade.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s20b02.wav",
   "end": 233.23,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s20b03": {
   "scene": "s20",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 233.73,
   "end": 236.23
  },
  "s20b04": {
   "scene": "s20",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 236.23,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And my fear smiled.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s20b04.wav",
   "end": 237.81
  },
  "s20b05": {
   "scene": "s20",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 238.21,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And went back to my other emotions, to help me.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s20b05.wav",
   "end": 241.58,
   "sfx": [
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s21b01": {
   "scene": "s21",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 242.53,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Then I saw the old cage.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s21b01.wav",
   "end": 244.43
  },
  "s21b02": {
   "scene": "s21",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 244.73,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "The gate was rusted, and hanging open.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s21b02.wav",
   "end": 247.5,
   "sfx": [
    "rust_creak"
   ]
  },
  "s21b03": {
   "scene": "s21",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 248.0,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "But that was just a small detail.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s21b03.wav",
   "end": 250.11
  },
  "s22b01": {
   "scene": "s22",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 251.51,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "Because the scene changed, to my emotions pressing the console buttons.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s22b01.wav",
   "end": 256.1,
   "sfx": [
    "console_beeps"
   ]
  },
  "s22b02": {
   "scene": "s22",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 256.5,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the void, standing in the background.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s22b02.wav",
   "end": 259.16
  },
  "s22b03": {
   "scene": "s22",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 259.56,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "And the rusty time-out cage, barely visible, in the back of my mind.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s22b03.wav",
   "end": 265.09
  },
  "s22b04": {
   "scene": "s22",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 265.59,
   "end": 267.59,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  },
  "s23b01": {
   "scene": "s23",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 268.49,
   "end": 269.99
  },
  "s23b02": {
   "scene": "s23",
   "kind": "line",
   "start": 269.99,
   "speaker": "NARRATOR",
   "text": "After that, I may have shed a tear or two myself.",
   "inner": false,
   "audio": "audio/wav/s23b02.wav",
   "end": 273.36
  },
  "s23b03": {
   "scene": "s23",
   "kind": "silent",
   "start": 274.16,
   "end": 277.66,
   "sfx": [
    "twinkle"
   ]
  }
